        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Patina- Text to Material\n\nGenerate a complete, seamlessly tiling PBR material from a text prompt with Patina. One run returns a base texture plus basecolor, normal, roughness, metalness and height maps that line up pixel for pixel, so the whole set drops straight into a 3D material. Works best on structured surfaces such as wood, stone, metal, fabric and ceramic tile; connect an image, optionally with a mask, to repaint an existing surface instead of inventing one. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_patina_material_t2m.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
